      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bino n'ebifo Abaisiraeli bye baajanga nga basimbamu weema dhaibwe, bwe baava e Misiri nga bali bikunsu bikunsu, nga Musa ni Aaroni babakulembeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yajanga ng'aghandiika buli kifo kye baavangamu okweyongerayo mu lugendo lwaibwe, nga Musengwa Katonda bweyamulagira. Era bino n'ebifo nga bwe byairaganwangaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baasitula okuva e Ramesesi mu Misiri, ku lunaku olweikumi n'eitaanu olw'omwezi ogusooka mu mwaka ogwo. Olwo n'olunaku olwairirira Ekibinuko eky'Okwidhukiriraku Okubitizibwa. Era Abaisiraeli baajiira mu kitiibwa ng'Abamisiri boonaboona babona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalekanga ng'Abamisiri bali kuziika abaana baibwe ababeri, Musengwa Katonda be yaita n'ayoleka nga bw'ali n'obuyinza okusinga emisambwa gyaibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Abaisiraeli baasitula okuva e Ramesesi, baaja baatuuka e Sukkothi, baasimba agho weema dhaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baava e Sukkothi, baaja baasimba weema dhaibwe mu Ethamu ekiri ku mbali okw'eirungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baava e Ethamu baakyuka baira einhuma, baabita e Pihahirothi ekiri e buvandhuba wa Baali Zefoni, baasimba weema dhaibwe kumpi ni Migidoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baava agho okumpi n'e Hahirothi, baabita ghagati mu Nhandha Emyufu baatuuka ku irungu ery'e Ethamu. Mu irungu eryo baatambulamu olugendo lwa nnaku isatu, olwo baatuuka e Mara baasimba agho weema dhaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baava e Mara, baaja mu Elimu aghaali ensulo eikumi n'eibiri n'emiti eminaazi ensanvu, baasimba agho weema dhaibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
