          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baali eyo e Yeriko, mu biketezo by'e Moabu eby'oku museetwe okuliiraana omwiga Yorudani, Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati: “Koba Abaisiraeli oti, bwemunaamala okusomoka Yorudani ni mungira mu Kanaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwidha kubingangamu abatyamye baamu boonaboona be munaayagaanangamu, muzikirizenga ebifaananie byaibwe byonabyona ebibaadhe mu mabaale, n'ebyo ebyakolebwa mu kyuma ekisaanuusiibwa, era musaaniengagho ebifo byaibwe ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidha kutwala ensi eyo mugibeemu, kuba ngibaghaire ebe yaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidha kugigabana mu bika byaimwe ni mu nda dhaimwe nga mukozesa obululu. Ekika ekinene mwidha kukigha ghanene, ate ekika ekitono mukighe ghatono. Omuntu akalulu ghe kanaamugha n'aghanaaba aghaghe, ng'agabanira mu kika kya ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.54+NUM.26.55+NUM.26.56"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 26:54-56",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bwe mutalisooka kubingamu batyamye be munaayagaanangamu, olwo abo be mulireka okusigalamu baja kubafuukira ng'oti n'ekintu ekikusonka mu liiso era ng'oti n'amawa agakufumita mu mbavu. Baja kubaleetera ebizibu kamaala mu nsi eyo ye mulibaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe mutalibabingamu, olwo kye nalowooza okukola beene ndikikola imwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
